<title>POLAND: NFI UNITS SEEN AT PLN 179 AT END-APRIL.</title>
<headline>NFI UNITS SEEN AT PLN 179 AT END-APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brokerages see mass privatisation National Investment Fund (NFI) units rising to 179 zlotys at April's end, 185 zlotys at end-June and to 205.75 zlotys at year-end, a Dziennik Prawa i Gospodarki poll said.</p>
<p>The poll appeared in the Monday edition of the paper that had previously called itself Nowa Europa.</p>
<p>The units closed at 145 zlotys in regular bourse trade on Friday.</p>
<p>Last month the units were seen ending June at 195.1 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
